WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Run analysis first
Check the file and mapping, then start analysis. Metrics without data may need additional columns.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Read the summary in context
Check the period and KPI denominator. Similar-looking metrics such as CPA and CPI can use different outcomes.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Narrow the period and channel
After changing filters, check the active scope and results. Do not compare mismatched periods, currencies or outcomes.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Choose the tab for your question
For LTV and ROAS, check the observation window and denominator. A revenue ratio alone does not establish profit or justify scaling.
